  "ingredients": [
    "1.25 cups graham cracker crumbs",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "0.25 cup butter, melted",
    "2 pounds sweet potatoes",
    "3 (8 ounce) packages cream cheese, softened",
    "0.875 cup white sugar",
    "0.33333334326744 cup sour cream",
    "0.25 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "3 eggs, room temperature",
    "0.75 cup packed brown sugar",
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "0.25 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "1 cup chopped pecans"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C ).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bc2qI1KPJyDsyhWkS8jY_LhYQ2I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8177-sweet-potato-cheesecake-VAT-step-01-d5dc7df1f658466082083c510bcf1960.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8177/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix graham cracker crumbs, 1/4 cup sugar, and 1/4 cup melted butter together in a bowl until combined. Press crumb mixture firmly and evenly across the bottom and slightly up the sides of a 9 ½-inch springform pan. Bake for 10 minutes; remove from oven and set aside. Keep the oven on.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tWI8guN5Pl08fGOl2Ug0pQF8YFY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8177-sweet-potato-cheesecake-VAT-step-02-9e8f752f93974f42b240cc092178cb71.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8177/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat cream cheese and 7/8 cup of white sugar until smooth. Mix in sour cream, 1/4 cup cream, and sweet potato puree. Beat in eggs one at a time, blending well after each. Pour filling into crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/z40zgbPkaGsmh3_AcJaRO-UEUVg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8177-sweet-potato-cheesecake-VAT-step-03-7902faa3b24f48fe9673687074ac1e43.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8177/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a tester inserted near the center comes out clean, about 1 hour (center may still be slightly jiggly). Turn off the oven. Let cake stand 1 hour in oven with door ajar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J2DPN-KvCruCfbQOMr5cePMqdlA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8177-sweet-potato-cheesecake-VAT-step-04-9d1904e55bd74abaa9c2e9214a8b4922.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8177/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the praline topping: Combine brown sugar and 1/4 cup butter in a heavy small saucepan. Stir over low heat until sugar dissolves. Increase heat, and bring to a boil. Mix in 1/4 cup cream, then add pecans.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RwUKDlGEyM94-7Yuu9mKU1vadOw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8177-sweet-potato-cheesecake-VAT-step-05-dbefec4d72c24b8a9ac2dcc7dfe51fef.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8177/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour hot praline topping over cheesecake. Store leftover cheesecake in the refrigerator.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LS2WquEhqoMMYxl3WAloH4SmSVs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8177-sweet-potato-cheesecake-VAT-step-06-9e28866322cf42738da615e475e5b9d3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8177/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
